SY_TALK("GnkKrCMd7fg",[[0,["Public Program Day 1, Seekers are the Highest Creation"]],[5,["Heartwood Community Center, Santa Cruz (United States)","17-10-1981"]],[1172,["I am very fortunate and I am very happy that","I could come to Santa Cruz."]],[1182,["I can see what I am facing is the ocean of","Love, the seekers of Love, the people who"]],[1194,["are seeking the Truth."]],[1198,["Gregoire has told you all these things because","he is very earnest, he is very concerned,"]],[1204,["he knows you are seekers and that’s why","he has told you in these words, so don’t"]],[1210,["be frightened."]],[1211,["There is nothing to be frightened about anything."]],[1215,["You are seekers and you are a special category."]],[1222,["In the eyes of God, seekers are the highest","creation that He has created."]],[1228,["You are the highest of all."]],[1233,["To Him it does not matter who are rich, who","are in power, who are leading a life of so-called"]],[1246,["success."]],[1247,["It does not matter to Him at all, He does","not understand that, He does not know that."]],[1251,["Christ has said that these people if they","want gold, let them have."]],[1257,["They’ll have bars of gold and live with","it."]],[1261,["But “if they seek Me, if they love Me,”","then these people who are seekers today are"]],[1276,["going to enter into the Kingdom of God and","He will eat with them."]],[1281,["They will sit at the same table."]],[1286,["You are respected because you are seekers."]],[1290,["You are loved because you are seekers."]],[1293,["And you have survived despite all the attacks","on you."]],[1301,["These are all attacks."]],[1304,["You are naîve, you are simple, you were innocent","at that time when attacks came in."]],[1309,["Now gradually you are discovering that it","was an attack."]],[1314,["Everything that you did was just to put you","down."]],[1320,["And one person who was negative of that kind","would come forward and assert and use all"]],[1328,["the negative forces to push you down."]],[1334,["To me you are my children."]],[1339,["To me I don’t think what you have done because","you didn’t meet me that time."]],[1348,["I take the load upon myself."]],[1351,["I did come to San Jose last time."]],[1355,["They said that there are lots of seekers settling","down in Santa Cruz."]],[1364,["I wanted to come and see you here that time","only, but the experience I had of the people"]],[1376,["who were there, I thought, “They are not","just now seeking God, but they are sort of"]],[1381,["seeking ego or superego, they are seeking","into a new style of life and a new style of"]],[1390,["understanding, because they have found out","that material life is of no value, it’s"]],[1394,["not going to give them joy.\""]],[1397,["At that time, when I said that, and you are","thinking of these things, how can you pay"]],[1402,["for it?"]],[1404,["Nobody could understand these things."]],[1406,["It was very difficult to talk to them – that","it is spontaneous, it is your own right, that"]],[1411,["you have to get it."]],[1412,["You have been seeking for ages now, not only","in this life time."]],[1416,["You have been saints in many lives and now","you are born here to seek it."]],[1422,["It’s so simple as that."]],[1425,["It has to happen, that’s your nature, that’s","what you are."]],[1430,["You try anything else, you won’t be satisfied","‘till you have found out the Truth."]],[1437,["But that time nobody would listen to me."]],[1438,["It was a very funny situation and I ultimately","decided that let them find out for themselves"]],[1446,["to begin with."]],[1447,["When they will find it out, they have to reach","the right conclusion."]],[1452,["Because there is one problem in the seeking,","that you have to seek in your own freedom,"]],[1460,["in your own glory of your own choice."]],[1466,["Because if you are to be liberated, it has","to be a free choice."]],[1471,["If a person is not free, say, he is enticed","or he is hypnotised or he is overpowered by"]],[1476,["others, he has no freedom at all of any kind."]],[1480,["Such a person is useless to enter into the","Kingdom of God."]],[1483,["If you have to become the King, then you have","to have that basic freedom in yourself intact."]],[1492,["But freedom doesn’t mean ego by any chance."]],[1498,["If you think: “I like it, I love it, I do","it,” that’s not the Spirit."]],[1505,["You are not seekers of ego, I must tell you","very frankly, you are not."]],[1508,["You are seekers of Truth, of Love, of Joy."]],[1515,["For ages you’ve been seeking that."]],[1517,["Joy is the result when you get to that position","where you become your Spirit, your Atma."]],[1525,["You should be in Joy, not talking about it,","but enjoying it."]],[1530,["And that has to happen to you."]],[1533,["It’s a happening for which you have built","in for ages."]],[1538,["Today, in general, I will tell you what you","are really and what you have to expect."]],[1544,["To become what?"]],[1547,["Nobody has told you about it."]],[1548,["They said, “All right, you’ll come to","us into a new age.\""]],[1553,["“All right,” people said."]],[1555,["“Let’s go and join!” Somebody says that","you’ll get this."]],[1559,["You joined."]],[1563,["William Blake is one of the greatest prophets","of the modern times."]],[1570,["For you Western people, he said that “The","men of God,” that means you people."]],[1578,["You are people of God."]],[1580,["You are not of this gross level."]],[1582,["If people don’t understand you that does","not mean that I don’t understand."]],[1586,["I know you, what you are."]],[1587,["I know what it is, I can feel it."]],[1594,["He said, “Men of God will become prophets,","and these prophets will have powers to make"]],[1601,["others prophets.\""]],[1605,["This is what we have to expect within ourselves."]],[1620,["So you have to become the prophet and you","have to make others prophet."]],[1630,["Now this is the point you should judge: Have","you become the prophet?"]],[1638,["What is a prophet?"]],[1641,["Prophet is a person who can feel the all-pervading","power around."]],[1652,["Now I said there is all-pervading power of","Love."]],[1655,["Oh you also sing the song, they say, “Yes,","there is all-pervading power.\""]],[1661,["Many people also feel that they are feeling","it, but it’s not true."]],[1666,["We have to be honest to ourselves because","we are seekers, we should not cheat ourselves"]],[1671,["because this is ego that makes you cheat."]],[1677,["This intelligence is the worst thing."]],[1679,["Gregoire himself told me one day, “I find","my intelligence is trying to cheat me.\""]],[1684,["Very intelligently."]],[1689,["So one has to be very careful to understand","that you have to become that."]],[1695,["You are the loser, you are the loser. Nobody else."]],[1699,["If you play around with your ego, your superego,","your conditionings or mesmerism or hypnosis,"]],[1707,["and your ideas about having a kind of life,","you are the loser."]],[1711,["All that could be a great barrier to be the","Spirit, which is a different thing altogether,"]],[1717,["is beyond this."]],[1721,["So when you become the Spirit, what happens","to you, what should you expect?"]],[1727,["Of course it’s true that this all-pervading","power is there."]],[1736,["Now if I say there are lots of plays going on","here, there is a music going on here, you"]],[1741,["won’t believe."]],[1744,["If I bring the television and say, “Now,","this is the one which is going to show you.\""]],[1747,["You will say, “Oh.\""]],[1748,["I mean, you know it."]],[1749,["But in India, if I take it to a village who","has never seen a television, they’ll say,"]],[1753,["“This box?"]],[1754,["How can it do it?” But you put it to the","mains and fantastic things can happen."]],[1760,["It catches all that."]],[1763,["In the same way, when you become that, when","you get a little breakthrough, it’s just"]],[1772,["the plugging to the mains."]],[1773,["You are all ready for that."]],[1778,["And the fantastic thing happens."]],[1779,["First you start feeling it all around."]],[1783,["Now don’t jump into ego."]],[1787,["That’s not the end of it."]],[1789,["You first start feeling it."]],[1793,["Then you start understanding that your centres","are on your fingertips."]],[1802,["It means that you are the master of that."]],[1807,["And then you start feeling around"]],[1811,["and you know it is there"]],[1814,["Then I´m here jus to decode it, to tell you,","this is what this finger mean \"this\""]],[1818,["You verify it."]],[1821,["It is so much surprising when people verify","it."]],[1825,["There was a gentleman in London."]],[1828,["I had seven hippies in London and I worked","on them for four years, English people are"]],[1838,["a little difficult to crack."]],[1839,["But after four years they really got their","realization in a proper way and after that"]],[1849,["now we have thousands of people who are realized","in England."]],[1855,["Because once they find something, then they","get to it."]],[1861,["They’re not the people who are shifty."]],[1864,["Somehow they have that much wisdom, that balance","in them."]],[1869,["They understand that if you have found a little","water in a place, then go on digging there"]],[1876,["alone to have the well."]],[1877,["They don’t leave that and go to another","place and dig well and dig well and dig well."]],[1882,["They can know where to stop."]],[1886,["So these people were very skeptical in the","beginning."]],[1892,["One of them got Realization and he said, “Mother,","it is all pervading, it has got telecommunication"]],[1901,["and everything."]],[1903,["What about my Father who has not telephoned","to me and who always writes to me and has"]],[1910,["not written to me?"]],[1911,["He’s in Scotland.\""]],[1913,["I said, “You trunk call him just now.\""]],[1915,["I said, “You feel it."]],[1917,["Just put your hands like that.\""]],[1920,["And he said,”I am getting a burning here.\""]],[1922,["I said:”That means he must be down with","very bad bronchitis."]],[1928,["These are the centers of your father and this","is the finger which denotes this center."]],[1934,["You telephone to him and find out.\""]],[1936,["He telephoned to him and the mother said exactly","the same centers, that he’s down with very"]],[1943,["bad bronchitis."]],[1945,["This could be a cock and bull story."]],[1949,["The way Gregoire was telling you, he was trying","to establish my credibility to you, because"]],[1960,["it is such an apologetic condition in which","I have come."]],[1964,["It‘s a very funny situation, I know that."]],[1968,["The other day I went to see a very influential","Indian man."]],[1974,["Of course, he knows me, because of my husband","maybe."]],[1978,["He knows that a person of that status may","not come to this level of cheating others,"]],[1984,["whatever it is."]],[1985,["But still he told me that he can’t understand","how people are taking to these horrible gurus"]],[1996,["and how these gurus came and cheated me also","and I helped them."]],[2002,["In Sahaja Yoga, it’s a spontaneous happening,","a living happening."]],[2015,["You are a living being and the force of God","is also living."]],[2021,["Just like a fruit comes out of a flower, just","like this living process takes place, you"]],[2034,["become your Spirit."]],[2037,["We never think this thing is around us, every","day we see."]],[2043,["This is worked out by this all pervading Power."]],[2046,["We can’t do even with one flower."]],[2050,["We cannot transform even one flower into a","fruit."]],[2054,["We take it for granted."]],[2056,["We never know that all such living things","are done."]],[2060,["Now look at it."]],[2061,["There is a little bird, which lays the egg."]],[2065,["For what?"]],[2066,["The eggs are kept in the nest."]],[2069,["The all pervading Power works it out in such","a way that the eggs grow and the bird hatches"]],[2077,["them and from these eggs comes out a bird."]],[2084,["We have seen caterpillars turning into butterflies."]],[2088,["We never think how it happens."]],[2090,["We just take it for granted."]],[2093,["We enjoy their colors."]],[2094,["We never see how this transformation has taken","place and this transmutation has taken place."]],[2102,["In Sanskrit language a realized soul is called","as dwijaha, is the one who is born twice."]],[2109,["Of course, this is also another problem."]],[2111,["Last time I said you are to be born actually","again."]],[2116,["It is a living process."]],[2117,["The Kundalini has to move throughout the centers","and you have to feel the actualization of"]],[2124,["your Realization, meaning that you must feel","the cool breeze coming out of your fontanelle"]],[2129,["bone area."]],[2131,["Realization you have to feel."]],[2133,["It’s an actualization, not a vague belief,","I told them hundred times."]],[2138,["And they were taping me."]],[2141,["Some people told me, ”Mother, don’t allow","them to tape.\""]],[2143,["I said, “Let them tape! What’s the matter?"]],[2146,["I am not running any enterprise.\""]],[2148,["They said, “No, they will use it for some","purpose.\""]],[2153,["I said, “Let them use it."]],[2155,["For what purpose they are going to use I don’t","understand.\""]],[2157,["I don’t understand these human laws."]],[2159,["I am very bad at it."]],[2162,["And human beings I am also worse."]],[2165,["These people met me the other day in Sydney","after so many years."]],[2171,["They have branded themselves as born again."]],[2174,["And they just self-certificated that we are","born again."]],[2179,["I said, ”But how?”"]],[2181,["“But we are born again.\""]],[2184,["“But what is the proof that you are born","again, my children?"]],[2190,["How do you believe you are born again?"]],[2191,["There must be some proof of it."]],[2194,["“Oh, we are born again."]],[2195,["Finished.\""]],[2196,["Now, you cannot self-certify yourself."]],[2199,["If you do that, it is Ego."]],[2202,["Understand that."]],[2203,["If you are born again, you should be able","to feel the centers of other people, you should"]],[2211,["be able to feel your own centers, you should","be able to judge yourself and cure yourself"]],[2219,["and you could cure others."]],[2221,["Not only that, but you can raise their Kundalini","and give them Realization."]],[2226,["This is the minimum of minimums to them."]],[2234,["I mean an egg, if it is chanting, “I am","a bird,” does it become?"]],[2237,["It’s an egg and an egg is an egg."]],[2240,["If it says, “Oh, I am","a bird.\""]],[2242,["It can’t fly."]],[2246,["It has to really fly."]],[2249,["If you tell the egg:"]],[2251,["\"Mrs egg, would you please fly?\""]],[2255,["Some of the nursery rhymes are Humpty Dumpty","sat on the wall."]],[2259,["That’s what they are."]],[2261,["They believe that they are great people."]],[2264,["They sat on the wall and when they fell down,","all the King’s horses and all the King’s"]],[2270,["men could not put them together again."]],[2273,["This is what it is,"]],[2275,["this is a make believe, that we are born again."]],[2278,["But it’s of no use to you."]],[2282,["You are Seekers."]],[2284,["You are nothing but Seekers of Spirit."]],[2287,["Accept that situation, first of all."]],[2290,["Accept your Self."]],[2292,["These false certificates are not going to","help you, by any chance."]],[2298,["Again I go away, you find another Guru, get","after him, get after another, get after another"]],[2304,["one."]],[2305,["Some of them just end up into a lunatic Asylum."]],[2307,["I don’t know what to do with them."]],[2311,["When this happens to you, physically you feel","all right."]],[2318,["I mean cancers can only be cured through your","Kundalini awakening."]],[2322,["I’ve been saying this for the last ten years."]],[2325,["I’ve also cured cancer automatically of","people as a by product."]],[2329,["All diseases get cured.-That is the minimum","of minimum that should happen to you."]],[2334,["After all, Realization is not some sort of","a cheap thing you can buy in the market like"]],[2340,["a take away food."]],[2343,["It is your Spirit, which is an eternal Being,","which you achieve."]],[2351,["You achieve your absolute value."]],[2352,["You become that though it happens so spontaneously,","so easily that you can’t believe."]],[2358,["You have no self esteem."]],[2360,["You can’t believe it that you have really","got it in the beginning."]],[2363,["People just don’t believe it."]],[2365,["It is impossible, they can believe it","that this has happened."]],[2369,["And when they don’t believe it, they don’t","want to practice it any further."]],[2373,["It’s so surprising."]],[2377,["First you have to get the sprouting of Kundalini","and then you have to allow it to grow and"]],[2385,["once you grow into it, then you are like a","tree."]],[2391,["As Gregoire says it’s true."]],[2393,["He was here in Santa Cruz, went to Berkeley,","there he met a very good Sahaja Yogi from"]],[2402,["India and just came down to London."]],[2406,["That time I saw him and I said, “Look at","this Seeker coming down.\""]],[2409,["I went to receive him at the station and I","was surprised – he was so frantic, he was"]],[2416,["so upset and I was surprised that the centers…","I know what he was."]],[2421,["He is a Seeker, I know that."]],[2423,["That had such love, and such feeling."]],[2427,["I said, “ Look at this my child."]],[2428,["Where is he lost?"]],[2429,["What has happened to you?”"]],[2434,["Now, we have to know what we are, what we","have to achieve and where we are to go."]],[2439,["That’s an important thing."]],[2440,["As I have told you, you must know what you","have to achieve, what you get."]],[2445,["In a very gross way I’ve told you."]],[2446,["Actually, it’s so dynamic, it is so fantastic","that if I tell you any more stories of it,"]],[2454,["you’d say it’s really a cock and bull","story."]],[2458,["But there is God."]],[2460,["He’s there, no doubt and He is dynamic and","He is all powerful and that He is all Love"]],[2468,["and that He loves you so much that he wants","you to enjoy His Kingdom."]],[2473,["It’s true, no doubt about it."]],[2476,["I am here to prove everything to you, not","to talk and give sermons and all that, but"]],[2481,["to prove it to you."]],[2484,["And his Powers are so fantastic, at every","level how they work out is amazing."]],[2495,["You have to just become."]],[2498,["Becoming is the main thing."]],[2500,["Now, as far as I am concerned, I am Your Mother."]],[2507,["You have every right on me."]],[2512,["I shouldn’t say I am your guru because I","am only here to connect you to your Self and"]],[2517,["you become your own guru, you","don't need any Guru anymore."]],[2521,["Once you are connected to the mains you become","your own guru."]],[2524,["You know this Warren Reeves, Dr."]],[2527,["Warren Reeves."]],[2528,["He came to me and I had to stick on to him","because he was all the time running away."]],[2536,["He has been to so many gurus who pampered","his ego –-”Oh, you are a great seeker,”"]],[2542,["“You are already a realized soul.\""]],[2544,["All these things are sticking onto his head","and it was very difficult to get him together."]],[2551,["And also I do not work in the city."]],[2554,["I actually work in the villages of India where","really thousands of people have got realization."]],[2558,["We have seen six thousand people get their","Self realization at a time."]],[2562,["But Indians are wise people and they are the","people who do not indulge into extremes."]],[2571,["In their seeking also they are wise and they","know what to expect."]],[2575,["So, it’s easy for me to work out."]],[2578,["They are innocent people still not exposed","to the material things that you have."]],[2586,["Though you’ve denied it, but you can’t","help it."]],[2588,["Your brain is modern."]],[2589,["You may try to look like primitive people."]],[2591,["The brain is modern."]],[2593,["What can you do?"]],[2594,["Think, think, think, think, think."]],[2596,["Just by changing your brain, you do not become","that."]],[2600,["This is the point we should know."]],[2602,["So, it’s easy there to work it out and in","the Indian villages you don’t even get sometimes"]],[2608,["a car to move out."]],[2609,["You have to go in a bullock cart and there","is no bathroom, you have to go to the river."]],[2615,["It’s all right for a change or holiday,","but when you have to be with me three months"]],[2619,["like that, it was too much for him."]],[2621,["But still he managed and now you will be amazed,","he has established seven centers in seven"]],[2627,["cities in Australia."]],[2630,["If you ask him how many people he has given","realization, he will say, “I don’t remember.\""]],[2636,["So, one light which has been enlightened,","can enlighten another light."]],[2640,["But the first light has to be an enlightened","light."]],[2644,["Once you say that you are enlightened, everybody’s","ego starts coming up."]],[2649,["It’s very common with the Western people."]],[2652,["Every time I went to some place they said,","“Why you of all the things, Mother?”"]],[2657,["I said, “It’s all right."]],[2659,["You come along, It’s a good idea."]],[2661,["I would like to retire.\""]],[2663,["I said, “My husband would pay a man who","can do my job."]],[2666,["It’s a thankless job to work for days and","nights together and he will be very happy"]],[2674,["to do that for you.\""]],[2694,["This problem of becoming is not yours, is","mine for the time being."]],[2704,["When you become that, then it is yours."]],[2707,["Once I know how to swim I can save you."]],[2711,["If I do not know how to swim how can I make","you swim?"]],[2716,["When you learn how to swim you can also save","other people."]],[2719,["It’s very simple."]],[2720,["But even if you say it is saving, people get","frightened."]],[2724,["No, it’s becoming."]],[2727,["It’s what you are."]],[2729,["To get to that is the point."]],[2732,["I would like to tell you what we are and what","is going to happen to us when we become realized"]],[2740,["souls."]],[2741,["It’s a gross manifestation of the powers","I told you."]],[2744,["When you became human beings you got your","awareness in a different way than the animals"]],[2750,["have, because for the animals, for example,","they do not understand the beauty of this"]],[2753,["room."]],[2754,["They won’t."]],[2755,["They don’t understand anything that is filthy","or dirty, they have no smell power."]],[2760,["Somehow they’ve managed."]],[2761,["They can live under any circumstances without","smelling anything."]],[2766,["We don’t have to learn anything from animals."]],[2770,["We are on top of all the creation and we have","to assume our position."]],[2777,["Once you have assumed your position, you become","that and once you become that, then you will"]],[2785,["be surprised to see how fantastic you are."]],[2787,["That is the discovery you have to have."]],[2791,["Within ourselves I think all of you got this","unique discovery so it’s easy for you to"]],[2796,["see what I’m about to say."]],[2799,["You will be amazed this lecture which I gave","about ten years back in India to begin with"]],[2804,["after there have been many lectures."]],[2806,["But if you have this is a good idea."]],[2808,["You can go home and see for yourself."]],[2809,["But you also have a little pamphlet."]],[2814,["On the back side is the complete picture of","the Kundalini."]],[2830,["Now, this is the God, the Primordial Being,","who has made you in His own image."]],[2844,["But still there’s the reflector, the human","being, which is not complete."]],[2849,["Within us lies this subtle mechanism, which","is called the tantra."]],[2861,["This is the real tantra, holy tantra, is an","auspicious thing, which gives us righteousness."]],[2870,["You see, when we think of the tantrikas, they","are the worst of all."]],[2873,["They make money,"]],[2875,["they do all kinds of violence, they teach","all kinds of nonsensical things."]],[2880,["I mean they indulge into any kind of sex."]],[2884,["They use your women, they use your money,","they do all kinds of things."]],[2887,["This is the holy mechanism, this is the pure","mechanism, is the purity, is completely pure"]],[2900,["Love, is not biased."]],[2904,["This mechanism exists within you and expresses","itself outside in the gross also to a great"]],[2913,["extent."]],[2915,["It expresses itself, on the left-hand side,","as the power of your Desire (iccha shakti)."]],[2935,["This expresses itself within us as our emotions,","as our psyche."]],[2943,["Gregoire has rightly said that Freud was quite","half-baked because he knew only one part of"]],[2948,["the human being and that, too, was very little","of the psyche."]],[2952,["Because all the scientists see things from","outside in."]],[2955,["If you see a tree from outside, if there is","something wrong with the leaf, you try to"]],[2960,["treat the leaf."]],[2962,["But how to treat the whole tree is through","the roots."]],[2966,["So you go to the roots of your being and these","are the roots."]],[2975,["One side of it is the Power of Desire and","it works out after the first center."]],[2984,["I’ll be telling you tomorrow morning about","these centers."]],[2988,["The another power is the power of action,","which enacts your Desire"]],[2996,["whick works out your desire."]],[2998,["this yellow color."]],[3000,["This gives you your future."]],[3005,["You enter into your future by your planning,","by your thinking, for working out."]],[3010,["The left side gives you your past."]],[3014,["It goes on accumulating on the left-hand side","and the deeper you move on the left-hand side"]],[3023,["there is the collective subconscious."]],[3025,["First the subconscious and then the collective","subconscious."]],[3029,["Now this is very important to know that when","we indulge too much into the left subconscious,"]],[3037,["that is a very dangerous situation, as well","as if you move into your right-hand side is"]],[3044,["the supra conscious and then to the collective","supraconscious, is also a very dangerous situation."]],[3052,["Moving into the left and the right is the","easy thing for human beings to do because"]],[3060,["if you want to do something, if you try to","do something about it and if you are not spontaneous,"]],[3067,["what happens?"]],[3069,["That your sympathetic nervous system, which is","governed by this subtle energy, goes into"]],[3077,["action and you either move into the left side","or into the right side."]],[3082,["For example, if you want to run, as these","days many people are just running, (You can"]],[3089,["run once in a while, but all the time running","– what is the need?"]],[3092,["Human beings are delicate things."]],[3095,["The way we go headlong into everything like","a bull in a china shop is not necessary."]],[3101,["The way you ruin yourself also, because you","think this body is your own, do what you like."]],[3106,["You must respect your body."]],[3109,["This is the Temple of God.) So, when you start","overdoing something on the left or the right"]],[3116,["side, say some people are crying, weeping,","singing praise of death and all that, so have"]],[3121,["it."]],[3122,["Some people say we must suffer."]],[3125,["Alright, then you suffer, have Hitler on top","of your head."]],[3128,["If you want more, you can have them, any number."]],[3132,["There are already so many coming to make you","suffer."]],[3135,["There is no need for you to suffer."]],[3137,["Somebody has suffered for you, once and for","all."]],[3141,["There is no need for you to suffer anymore."]],[3144,["You are just ready to enter into the Kingdom","of God."]],[3148,["If you try to go too much on the left-hand","side or too much on the right-hand side, you"]],[3155,["feel that you have gone into a new world."]],[3158,["You have not."]],[3160,["For example, take a simple thing like LSD."]],[3164,["Now, what happens when you take LSD?"]],[3168,["When you take LSD, you move to the right side."]],[3170,["You start seeing the light,"]],[3172,["you start seeing the eyes and all that."]],[3175,["Is a movement of the right-hand side."]],[3177,["Actually, you put your Ego to the right-hand","side and you start seeing that and once you"]],[3183,["see that you do not become anything, you just","see it."]],[3187,["Seeing it is not becoming, you have to become."]],[3190,["And once you start seeing it, you think you","have become a higher personality."]],[3195,["It’s absolutely wrong."]],[3196,["You are under the control of something else."]],[3201,["You are not yourself."]],[3207,["The last word on the collective supraconscious","was Hitler."]],[3215,["He got lost completely."]],[3218,["He was using tantrikas, these horrible people,","and he was using all that knowledge, so called,"]],[3229,["how to use these forces."]],[3231,["The forces come to you through dead spirits","who are very powerful in their lifetime, and"]],[3238,["those who are not, give up that idea of domination","and they are on this earth still all around."]],[3246,["The left-sided people are the people who indulge","into other kind of things like-alcohols and"]],[3252,["ganjas and all these things, by which you","become sort of all the time crying, weeping,"]],[3260,["this, that."]],[3261,["In that you see your past."]],[3265,["Is a good idea in a way, but a bad idea also","in a way, because you are in the present,"]],[3270,["not in your past."]],[3271,["Past does not exist any more, it’s finished","now."]],[3276,["What exists is the present."]],[3278,["Either you are in the future or in the past","and when you go too much into it you get identified"]],[3284,["and you think this is what is the Truth, which","is not."]],[3287,["I have to tell you that it is not."]],[3291,["What is the Truth is your Spirit."]],[3293,["That it is your evolutionary process has to, little bit","trigger it and that’s how you become."]],[3303,["By becoming that what happens to you?"]],[3305,["You don’t start jumping like mad."]],[3307,["No, it’s not."]],[3308,["Anybody can jump."]],[3309,["Is it difficult to jump?"]],[3312,["Some people who said that we went for a flying","course."]],[3315,["They paid 3000 Pounds to fly."]],[3318,["What is the need?"]],[3319,["You don’t want to become birds or frogs,","do you?"]],[3323,["And they were nothing but frogs jumping."]],[3327,["In my presence they were jumping like that."]],[3328,["I didn’t know how to control."]],[3333,["And they paid 3000 pounds for this."]],[3336,["The other day in a plane I had somebody from","that kind of a thing was sitting and he was"]],[3341,["all the time doing like this because I was","sitting behind him."]],[3343,["I said, ”I think I better get out from there","and go out the back.\""]],[3346,["You are not in your own control."]],[3349,["You have to be your own master."]],[3351,["Now you must know this, that you should be","able to control yourself is the main point."]],[3357,["Like in a car, there are these two powers."]],[3360,["One is the brake and the other is the accelerator."]],[3367,["First, you don’t know how to drive."]],[3370,["You are sitting and first you are going into","a ditch, then sometimes you are getting out"]],[3376,["trying to balance it, then you know how to","drive."]],[3380,["When do you know?"]],[3381,["When you know."]],[3383,["If you ask me, “Mother, when do we know","how to drive?” When we know."]],[3387,["It is an amazingly simple thing."]],[3389,["So, now you have managed both these."]],[3392,["First, you’ve made accident and have done","all mistakes, doesn’t matter."]],[3396,["As long as you learn how to drive, finished."]],[3399,["First you have a driving license, then you","start arranging these two things to keep yourself"]],[3406,["into balance."]],[3407,["You come into balance, still you are not the","master of the car, but you are master as far"]],[3414,["as the mechanism is concerned."]],[3416,["So, there is a master who is sitting, of the","car and of you."]],[3422,["In the beginning you should be master of your","body, master of everything."]],[3428,["Then, what happens, that you become the master","of the car as well."]],[3433,["First you balance yourself in such a way that","you know how to master your body, your mind"]],[3441,["and everything."]],[3442,["And then you become that by which you can","master other people also."]],[3447,["But mastery does not mean domination."]],[3449,["It’s Love."]],[3451,["It’s a wrong idea that a master is a person","who dominates."]],[3456,["It comes from where I don’t know."]],[3458,["Master is the one who loves, who really does."]],[3461,["He may just sometimes tell you don’t do","this because it’s wrong, the whole bad things"]],[3466,["happening, he may tell you."]],[3468,["But he is a comforter."]],[3471,["Comforter, because you have felt no Love in","your life."]],[3476,["The real Love you have not felt."]],[3480,["You want some place where you can get that","Love."]],[3482,["He is a comforter, is the left side."]],[3485,["In our Sahaja Yoga language we call the Comforter","as Mahakali."]],[3491,["She is the Holy Ghost."]],[3493,["From that Comforter other aspects come up."]],[3497,["The second aspect is what you call the Councelor,","The one who tells you what is what, decodes"]],[3508,["everything, tells you how to manage, how to","go ahead."]],[3511,["Like an instructor and you verify that."]],[3515,["The second one in our Sahaja Yoga is called","Mahasaraswati"]],[3524,["And the third one is the Redeemer,the one","who gives you moksha,"]],[3531,["through the Sushumna nadi, is called as Mahalaxmi."]],[3538,["These are the three powers which exist within","us."]],[3541,["The first manifests the left sympathetic,","the second one manifests the right sympathetic"]],[3550,["and the third one gives you the parasympathetic","which controls these two centers, which coordinates,"]],[3561,["cooperates and refills."]],[3563,["But it is still a limited amount of energy."]],[3568,["Some people tell me that they went to a person","and felt the energy."]],[3572,["What sort of an energy were you feeling?"]],[3574,["Very much like shaking and all that."]],[3577,["No, that’s not good."]],[3579,["If you are not possessed you should not shake","before a person."]],[3583,["On the contrary you start feeling the cool","breeze in the hands.You feel completely relaxed."]],[3593,["How do you know?"]],[3595,["What happens through Sahaja Yoga is the way,","is very good."]],[3599,["You should see for yourself."]],[3601,["Get three people – one from a lunatic asylum,","certified mad; get another one who is not"]],[3612,["realized; get the third one who is realized."]],[3617,["They sit down."]],[3618,["Now you ask them to put their hands towards","you."]],[3623,["Now the person who is lunatic will be doing","like this."]],[3628,["Now if there a cancer patient, he will be","emitting tremendous heat, so much so that"]],[3635,["you don’t need a heater, even in London","in December or January."]],[3639,["If there is somebody like that, you","don't need anything."]],[3644,["But supposing that person is just a normal,","balanced person, is in the center."]],[3651,["He starts feeling the cool breeze and the","realized soul starts feeling the whole thing"]],[3658,["coming on."]],[3659,["This is what you have to judge with people","when they come."]],[3666,["You should know what happens to them."]],[3670,["If you are seeking reality, you must know","that you have to face yourself as you are"]],[3678,["today."]],[3679,["You need not try to hide anything, because","there is nothing to be hidden from your mother."]],[3687,["I don’t care whatever you have done."]],[3689,["I just don’t bother."]],[3690,["It’s not necessary."]],[3692,["The first mantra in Sahaja Yoga to be said","is that Mother, I am not guilty."]],[3698,["You have to say that 16 times in your heart,"]],[3701,["that Mother, I´m not guilty"]],[3703,["This is the first mantra of Sahaja Yoga, because","in yourself whole things have crawled up into"]],[3714,["a diffidence in life."]],[3717,["Even the Ego sometimes gets hurt."]],[3721,["When you do mistakes or anything, it gets","hurt and when it gets hurt you get diffident,"]],[3727,["so it gets built up within you as diffident."]],[3730,["When you say, “Mother, I am not guilty,”","your self-esteem is established."]],[3735,["First day you’d better establish your self-esteem."]],[3741,["Within you lies this power of Kundalini."]],[3749,["I was very happy to know that people have","reached the conclusion that it is the Kundalini"]],[3753,["awakening which is going to do the job."]],[3758,["It is a very good conclusion you have reached."]],[3760,["But any Dick, Tom and Harry cannot do it,","one should know that."]],[3768,["Saying it is a sprouting, it’s a living","process."]],[3770,["Now, logically you should approach the subject."]],[3773,["You are all very intelligent people, I can","see that."]],[3776,["You are not stupid people."]],[3779,["Living things, like sprouting the seed."]],[3782,["If you want to sprout a seed, can you pull","it out?"]],[3787,["Or if you stand on your head, will it happen?"]],[3792,["They are such sweet things."]],[3797,["“Hello."]],[3803,["Alright now, sit down for a while.\""]],[3809,["They are realized souls."]],[3810,["They are born realized."]],[3811,["So many children are born realized and if","you are not realized [UNCLEAR parents] you"]],[3815,["are going to harm them."]],[3820,["You have to know what are they."]],[3825,["They know me better than you people do and","they are going to come up."]],[3830,["Wait for ten years before."]],[3833,["They are going to create that great, beautiful","mansion of Love for you."]],[3840,["So, this Kundalini is the power within us."]],[3847,["What power is this?"]],[3850,["This is the power of Primordial Desire within","us to be one with the Divine, to be united"]],[3862,["with the Divine and this is the Yoga."]],[3865,["All the rest of it is not."]],[3867,["Yoga is nothing, that as you are,"]],[3871,["you are to be connected with the","Divine, is the Yoga."]],[3876,["All right?"]],[3878,["If that is so, this desire is not yet manifested."]],[3881,["So, it is called as a sleeping Kundalini and","only the person who has that warmth of the"]],[3887,["Mother Earth can do it, as simple as that."]],[3892,["Everyone who thinks that Kundalini is to be","awakened must know it is a spontaneous, living"]],[3903,["happening, just like a sprouting of a seed."]],[3907,["You cannot just pull it out."]],[3910,["It cannot be done by any effort."]],[3913,["It’s spontaneous."]],[3915,["If it is evolutionary, logically we can find","out that we did nothing to become human beings"]],[3921,["from amoeba stage."]],[3922,["We didn’t cut our tails to become human","beings, did we?"]],[3930,["We didn’t do anything."]],[3932,["It has happened so spontaneously."]],[3933,["But where is the change in us, let’s see","again logically."]],[3938,["Not rationally, but logically."]],[3940,["Rationality could be quite mad."]],[3943,["Logically you should understand, what is the","difference we have got is in our awareness."]],[3953,["Something has to happen in awareness, not","in a way that you just start jumping or taking"]],[3958,["out your clothes and doing nonsensical things."]],[3964,["It’s very easy."]],[3965,["In the bathroom everybody does it."]],[3968,["What’s so great?"]],[3972,["But just understand."]],[3974,["You can see with your naked eye the pulsation","of the Kundalini."]],[3979,["Not in all."]],[3980,["If you are a first class instrument, it just","happens."]],[3984,["Like a jet it goes."]],[3986,["It’s a jet Kundalini in the jet age."]],[3990,["It has to happen to all of you."]],[3996,["Why some people said you have to do so much","and you have to do like this and you have"]],[4002,["to do that and you have to cleanse yourself","and then only you’ll get realization."]],[4008,["Why is it so simple today?"]],[4011,["The reason is the time has come."]],[4014,["In the beginning of a tree’s life one or","two flowers come in, but now the blossom time"]],[4023,["has come, so many seekers I see before me,","just like flowers about to become the fruits."]],[4029,["There were never so much seekers before."]],[4032,["Whatever you can say against the modern times","this is the outcome of that."]],[4037,["Without this chaos there would have been not","so many."]],[4041,["This is the time that he predicted that many","saints will be born at this time."]],[4047,["[UNCLEAR] imagine thousands of years back","it was written."]],[4049,["When this Kali Yuga, this modern time, the","one who created the Kali, he was caught up"]],[4058,["by somebody and he said, “Nala, what do","mean by torturing me and my wife like this."]],[4063,["I am going to kill you."]],[4065,["The Kali said, “Alright, you can kill me,","but you have to find out one thing about me."]],[4072,["You must know what I am and what I represent.\""]],[4076,["“What are you?"]],[4077,["Just tell me.\""]],[4078,["He said: “When the modern times will come,”","we call it as Kali Yuga, “at this time,"]],[4082,["these saints who are seeking God in the hills","and dales and in the Himalayas will be born"]],[4090,["as ordinary householders and they are going","to receive the blessings."]],[4094,["It’s already promised.\""]],[4098,["If so, that happening has to take place."]],[4103,["But as soon as people came to know that people","are seeking, the market got jammed."]],[4110,["and you got into the trap."]],[4119,["It’s a very subtle method of making money","out of you."]],[4125,["Now, I think, most of them are getting a little","worried, because all their advertising and"]],[4133,["all that is a little bit fading and they don’t","know how to find out new methods of advertising"]],[4138,["to get ‘round you."]],[4140,["These people are not interested in Indian","villages."]],[4145,["They are interested in Los Angeles or in Santa","Cruz where they can extract money."]],[4152,["It is an enterprise."]],[4156,["You cannot sell God, can you?"]],[4159,["You cannot organize it."]],[4161,["Some lady paid $4000 very recently and I heard","somebody told me that she went there, she"]],[4171,["danced, she took out her clothes, became mad","and came back."]],[4175,["You pay to go to lunatic asylum or what?"]],[4179,["But it helps you to go there because there’s","a fashion on."]],[4183,["Everybody is going, “Oh, I’ve been there","to that Guru.\""]],[4186,["It’s so maddening."]],[4193,["You must understand, you are the new forms","of the old ways."]],[4198,["In olden days, people who could donate for","a church were regarded as very religious."]],[4206,["Even now, I think, some of the Jews, they","have a diamond-jeweled bible and if they can"]],[4220,["tithe there they show it nicely that they","have got one."]],[4225,["All these false ideas of God you’d better","give up, because you are not followers, you"]],[4232,["are seekers."]],[4233,["Let them go on with that nonsense."]],[4236,["But you are seekers, so you take to the Truth","and you become that."]],[4242,["I think today, it’s quite a lot for you."]],[4245,["I would like you to ask me some questions,","but sensible questions and don’t be aggressive"]],[4248,["with me."]],[4249,["I am very clever."]],[4250,["As they told him, “She’s a masterpiece","of camouflage.\""]],[4254,["It’s true, I am, so be careful."]],[4257,["If you have any real questions ask me."]],[4260,["If you are not a true seeker and you are just","trying to show off, you are cheating yourself."]],[4266,["Don’t try to show off."]],[4268,["“I read this book.\""]],[4269,["“I read that book.\""]],[4270,["“This happened.\""]],[4271,["”What do you think of this Guru?” Don’t","bring me to controversies."]],[4272,["It’s unnecessary."]],[4273,["If they were of any value, you would have","been a realized soul."]],[4277,["I can make out from you who was your Guru","the way they have ruined your Kundalini."]],[4283,["Some of the Kundalinis are so ruined."]],[4286,["I see them just like wounded snakes, tossing","their heads like this."]],[4298,["It is so bleedy."]],[4300,["You don’t know how much they’ve corrupted","you."]],[4302,["Don’t ask me about these cruel people."]],[4306,["If I start blasting them, you’ll be amazed","how they are."]],[4310,["I love you very much, but I don’t love them."]],[4314,["I am wrathful, very angry with them, because","they are devils, satanic."]],[4321,["If they wanted money, they could have smuggled."]],[4324,["They could have done something like that,","but they should not have ruined your Kundalini."]],[4331,["They had no business to do it."]],[4333,["They will go to hell, no doubt, but they’ll","be carrying so many with them, they know that."]],[4341,["They are trying to overpower."]],[4343,["They are Anti-Christ."]],[4345,["They think they can win over God."]],[4347,["Let them know that God’s Powers are so powerful","that they can all be destroyed like this in"]],[4355,["one stroke."]],[4356,["The only thing why they are not destroyed","is because today they are in your brains."]],[4363,["Krishna has said,”Whenever there is the","fall of Dharma, fall of your values, your"]],[4370,["virtues, whenever the saints suffer, I come","on this Earth to save the Saints and kill"]],[4381,["the devils.\""]],[4383,["But the devils have gone into the Saints now."]],[4387,["It’s a problem, a dilemma for me."]],[4389,["What to do."]],[4390,["These devils have come into your brains."]],[4393,["They are to be taken out, first of all."]],[4396,["Just wait for me to finish."]],[4398,["Do not stick on to one question."]],[4399,["If you stick on, you’ll miss the whole point."]],[4402,["By questioning, you will not get Realization."]],[4405,["It’s not a mental activity."]],[4408,["It’s triggering beyond the mental activity."]],[4411,["This lecture is useless if you do not get","your Realization."]],[4414,["In the beginning of the Vedas it was written","that if you do not get the knowledge… Knowledge"]],[4418,["doesn’t mean going mad."]],[4420,["It doesn’t mean hypnosis."]],[4422,["But if you do not feel the all pervading Power,","then these Vedas are useless."]],[4427,["In the same way my lecture and all mental","activities are useless if you do not get your"]],[4431,["Realization."]],[4432,["That’s the main thing you must have."]],[4435,["All right?"]],[4436,["May God bless you."]],[4437,["Now, ask me a question."]],[4451,["Seeker: What is the best approach we can take","to go to Laxmi?"]],[4458,["Shri Mataji: I will tell you tomorrow about","Laxmi, where she is settled down."]],[4462,["That’s what we are going to do, all the","Goddess, not one."]],[4466,["All in one bundle."]],[4468,["Now what do you say to that?"]],[4469,["Alright, good idea."]],[4482,["Seeker: Asks about how to deal with her worries."]],[4488,["Alright, doesn’t matter."]],[4490,["We are going to work it out."]],[4491,["Don’t worry about your personal things."]],[4493,["It’s all","going to work out en masse."]],[4500,["Don’t worry about your personal things,"]],[4502,["just don´t worry."]],[4504,["There is nothing to worry"]],[4505,["it is going to work out."]],[4507,["Is a working out I must say."]],[4509,["Yes, please."]],[4514,["Dr."]],[4516,["Warren: She is asking whether you said to","say, “Mother, I am not guilty”."]],[4521,["Shri Mataji: Yes, yes, please, within yourself."]],[4524,["Very important."]],[4525,["What is it?"]],[4526,["Dr."]],[4527,["Warren:She is liking it!"]],[4528,["Shri Mataji: Good, good."]],[4530,["May God bless you."]],[4531,["Don’t feel guilty at all."]],[4533,["Otherwise I would not come here."]],[4536,["The ones who have harmed you are guilty."]],[4551,["Seeker: What is your capacity and our capacity","to hate the devils."]],[4559,["Most religions preached that we should not","be angry."]],[4563,["Shri Mataji: You should not be angry, but","with Devils?"]],[4568,["You run away from them."]],[4572,["Let me handle them."]],[4573,["You don´t worry."]],[4574,["You just don’t worry about them."]],[4576,["All right?"]],[4578,["It’s my job."]],[4579,["First of all you love yourself, have self-esteem,","know that you are the temple of God, Then"]],[4596,["you love by becoming realized, you become","collectively conscious."]],[4600,["Again the word becoming."]],[4602,["Then you start feeling the other within yourself."]],[4604,["Who is the other?"]],[4605,["I am not helping you, you are part and parcel","of my being."]],[4608,["If I am helping my finger, am I helping you?"]],[4613,["Then we see about the rest of the thing."]],[4615,["You don’t worry about them."]],[4639,["Seeker: Many of the people who come to my","clinic have activated their Kundalini too"]],[4648,["early and I’m wondering how to help them."]],[4651,["Shri Mataji: They do not activate their Kundalini,","they do not."]],[4657,["All these things are just to activate the","sympathetic and it’s very dangerous."]],[4664,["You can get blisters, you can get all kinds","of problems."]],[4669,["You can get cancer also."]],[4672,["I get so many people like that."]],[4674,["I’ll make you the masters."]],[4678,["It’s Love."]],[4680,["It cannot harm."]],[4681,["It’s your Mother."]],[4683,["That’s the only Mother you have and you","are the only child."]],[4687,["How can your Kundalini trouble you?"]],[4690,["She is just waiting for the moment to give","you realization."]],[4693,["She loves you the most of all."]],[4704,["And you cannot activate it, it just spontaneously","rises."]],[4712,["I was myself amazed to read some books on","Kundalini."]],[4717,["I said these people don’t know what Kundalini","is."]],[4719,["They tell lies"]],[4720,["They’re liars."]],[4721,["They are cheats writing such big books about","Kundalini without knowing a word, without"]],[4727,["having any authority."]],[4728,["You have to have Divine Authority, isn’t","it?"]],[4730,["You cannot get it in a Theological college","or any place you go to."]],[4734,["You can not."]],[4735,["Its a Divine Authority you must have."]],[4743,["Seeker: Should we love our enemies as well?"]],[4746,["Shri Mataji: First of all you love yourself","and your friends."]],[4748,["Then we can talk of enemies."]],[4757,["You have to know who are your enemies."]],[4760,["Actually, you don’t know who are your enemies."]],[4766,["First, we have to develop that discretion","power."]],[4772,["By your vibrations you will know who is who,","because once you are connected with the mains,"]],[4776,["you start feeling it."]],[4778,["You can ask any question whichever is an absolute","question."]],[4784,["You can ask is there God?"]],[4785,["You will start feeling a cool breeze coming","in."]],[4788,["Like a computer, you become connected with","the mains and you answer all these questions."]],[4792,["You develop your discretion and you will know","who are yours and who are not yours."]],[4799,["Before that you don’t know, you are so mixed","up."]],[4806,["Actually there are very few enemies that you","have, very few."]],[4817,["Should we now have it?"]],[4821,["You’ve got that door open there."]],[4826,["Just get one of the doors open for some of","the enemies to fly out."]],[4833,["Dr."]],[4836,["Warren: If anyone has their shoes on, take","them off and simply put your hands out towards"]],[4844,["Mataji as if asking for it."]],[4850,["Be humble about it."]],[4853,["Be open-minded."]],[4854,["If you’ve got a lot of questions…"]],[4856,["Shri Mataji: Sit comfortably."]],[4858,["There is nothing to put yourself to stay."]],[4860,["Your neck should be bending neither forward","nor backward."]],[4865,["There is no effort to be put in."]],[4867,["Just sit comfortably."]],[4868,["Kundalini will rise by itself and you’ll","get your Realization."]],[4871,["You don’t have to do anything."]],[4874,["Just don’t put your concentration onto one","point."]],[4877,["Some people have a habit of concentrating","here, concentrating there."]],[4880,["All those people who have done this concentration","business or, what is that the another one,"]],[4885,["putting the tongue back?"]],[4888,["(kechari mudra)."]],[4892,["Whatever you have done, all such people should","put their attention here (top of head)."]],[4900,["There is the door, not here."]],[4902,["That’s all."]],[4903,["But rest of the people just keep your attention","absolutely loose."]],[4912,["Now, close your eyes."]],[4915,["Keep your eyes closed, because Kundalini has","to pass through Agnya chakra and if your eyes"]],[4923,["are not closed, she won’t rise."]],[4927,["Put your hands towards me just like this."]],[4931,["All of you, please put your hands, because","in the hands you have those centers."]],[4937,["I would request you to take out if there is","anything heavy in your necks."]],[4940,["Please, take off."]],[4941,["It is better."]],[4942,["Also, if there is anything heavy or tight","on your waist."]],[4947,["You can loosen your belt a little bit."]],[4957,["Just put your hands towards me."]],[4976,["Close your eyes."]],[4996,["Please, put your right hand on your heart,","because Spirit resides in our heart."]],[5010,["Sit very comfortably without any strain on","your back."]],[5015,["That is very important."]]]);
